---
description: Keep .mds/design.md in sync with the site's design language
alwaysApply: true
---

- `.mds/design.md` is the source of truth for the website's design language (colors, type, shape, layout, components, motion).
- Any change that adds or alters design (new section, new component, token change) must update `.mds/design.md` in the same change.
- When the user asks to change the design language, update `.mds/design.md` first, then the code. Tokens in `src/style.css` `:root` must match it.
- Use the taste skill (`.agents/skills/design-taste-frontend/SKILL.md`) for UI work.
